{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>On the seventeenth day of the month</b> — וזה יבלו בטוב ימיהם (and this will consume the good of their days) = the numerical value of טוב (good), for on the seventeenth of the month the flood descended. וארבות השמים (and the windows of heaven) — in gematria: שלקח שני כוכבים מכימה (that He took two stars from Kimah)."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:55.840463191Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}